# REC held while the keys play (REC acts on its release): the take starts with the first key, which sounds and is recorded;
# letting REC go does not stop it. Before: REC + white was a layer's mute - nothing recorded, "the keys do nothing in REC"
wait 300
tap SAVE
wait 100
tapkey w4
wait 200
onnote 1
tap HOME
wait 100
press REC
wait 100
key w3 down 90
wait 200
expect recording 1
expect playing 1
expect livev >0
release REC
wait 100
expect recording 1
key w3 up
wait 300
key w5 down 90
wait 300
key w5 up
wait 1000
tap REC
wait 200
expect recording 0
tap PLAY
wait 200
expect events >1
